      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This went under the radar without patch notes in [VRChat 2026.1.1](https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/vrchat-202611) or [2026.1.1p1](https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/copy-of-vrchat-202611) and there was only a brief mention of this being upcoming in [Developer Update - December 18 2025](https://ask.vrchat.com/t/developer-update-december-18-2025/47354), either way VRC+ users can now change their display name with a shorter 30 days period (instead of the usual 90 days) on the VRChat Home website at [Account Settings](https://vrchat.com/home/profile) since a few days ago.\n\nThis feature request can be marked as Complete.",
