  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2025-07-08T11:00:47.091Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Hii !\n\nThe feature of being able to change your username is now 90 days, which I have noticed feels and is very long . . ! especially if you accidentally mess up on a new name you changed. you'll only be able to revert back to the previous username and wait ANOTHER 90 days . . Just to fix the typo.\n\nMy question is if this could be shortened? or make it so there is 2 possible name changes every 90 days?\n\nMaybe, possibly make it a VRC+ feature?\n\nI really hope there's something that can be done for this, my friends are also struggling and getting frustrated with it. LOL\n\nBye bye ! !",
